  messages:
  - actorId: 0
    message: 'Hey! I have a job for you. Please collect all the pipes on the map. '
  - actorId: 1
    message: Sure! What happens after?
  - actorId: 0
    message: For ever pipe you collect you can earn 3 coins. There are 5 pipes in
      total.
  - actorId: 0
    message: 'When you have gotten 12 coins a button appears,  make sure to talk
      to spoink jr before you click the button, he is right under me. '
